use firn/tags

freetds is a Module
freetds is tagged database

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.freetds.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.freetds]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."freetds"."enable": enable "FreeTDS (TDS protocol library for MSSQL)"
